{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 9220,
    "dDurationMs": 2150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hello, this is Didi."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 11370,
    "dDurationMs": 1660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hello, this is Jeong Tae-woong."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 13030,
    "dDurationMs": 3260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yomojomo is a podcast where two people living in Korea"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 16290,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "talk about the various aspects of life in Korea."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 19970,
    "dDurationMs": 6300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Actually, last time, last week we picked a topic related to YouTube, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 26270,
    "dDurationMs": 1060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 27330,
    "dDurationMs": 3780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We were going to talk about what it's like to live as a YouTuber,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 31110,
    "dDurationMs": 2180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but we got a request topic,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 33290,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so today we're going to talk about this instead."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 36470,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 37470,
    "dDurationMs": 1810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hello, Teacher Didi."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 39280,
    "dDurationMs": 4460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thank you so much for uploading so many fun podcasts."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 43740,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They're helping my studies a lot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 46220,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'd like to know what foods make you feel the following,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 49300,
    "dDurationMs": 2230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and what the differences are between each taste,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 51530,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I'd really appreciate it if you could explain them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 54140,
    "dDurationMs": 4870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If possible, I'd be grateful if two or more people could each share their own feelings."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 59010,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Since I'm Japanese,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 61090,
    "dDurationMs": 5090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's hard for me to distinguish the subtle differences in how spicy and tangy tastes are expressed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 66180,
    "dDurationMs": 3910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Saecomhada, maekkomhada, dalkomhada, eolkkeunhada,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 70090,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "eolkkeunhada, and so on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 71490,
    "dDurationMs": 610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 72100,
    "dDurationMs": 3910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And kalkalhada, dambaekhada, siwonhada,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 76010,
    "dDurationMs": 3350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "especially this expression, 'siwonhada',"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 79360,
    "dDurationMs": 3970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and sansseuthada, sangkeumhada, and so on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 83330,
    "dDurationMs": 4220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, so you said it's hard to distinguish between these expressions,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 87550,
    "dDurationMs": 4350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and today we're going to do our best to explain the differences in Korean taste expressions"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 91900,
    "dDurationMs": 3310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the two of us,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 95210,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so it seems like that kind of episode."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 98180,
    "dDurationMs": 4660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Isn't this usually the kind of content style that Didi makes alone?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 102840,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, like this?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 104320,
    "dDurationMs": 1360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, it is."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 105680,
    "dDurationMs": 970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the way it was mentioned here,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 106650,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "having two or more people talk about their feelings"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 109770,
    "dDurationMs": 3140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "seems like it would be easier to get a feel for it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 112910,
    "dDurationMs": 3310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I thought it would be good to talk about it with Teacher Tae-woong,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 116220,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that's why I brought this topic."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 120380,
    "dDurationMs": 2050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I need to announce last week's quiz answer,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 122430,
    "dDurationMs": 3830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but I made a mistake last time when editing the quiz."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 126260,
    "dDurationMs": 4490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So there was no answer last week."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 130750,
    "dDurationMs": 3510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This kind of mistake..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 134260,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You must have been a bit hasty with your Japan trip coming up?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 136450,
    "dDurationMs": 3260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's not like that..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 139710,
    "dDurationMs": 3790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There was something that was 'not mentioned' that was the problem,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 143500,
    "dDurationMs": 4760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I cut it out while trying to figure out the answer..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 148260,
    "dDurationMs": 4530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So anyway, there was no answer,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 152790,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and for this week's quiz, I'm going to give you another quiz after we finish talking,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 156180,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so please try to get that right, and this time I'll upload it without making a mistake."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 160820,
    "dDurationMs": 5320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, so then we're going to talk about taste expressions right away,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 166140,
    "dDurationMs": 3460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it seems like there are really a lot of words to express taste in Korea."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 169600,
    "dDurationMs": 4220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There seem to be a lot of words."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 173820,
    "dDurationMs": 3110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 176930,
    "dDurationMs": 420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm curious if it's the same in other countries too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 177350,
    "dDurationMs": 2710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 180060,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I think each country probably has diverse expressions for different tastes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 182070,
    "dDurationMs": 5330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For Korea, from what I looked up,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 187400,
    "dDurationMs": 2210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there seem to be quite a lot of spicy taste expressions, spicy taste expressions?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 189610,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Do you know that story?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 193930,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know about Eskimos?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 196890,
    "dDurationMs": 2530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are Eskimos, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 199420,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The language that Eskimos use"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 202810,
    "dDurationMs": 5720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "has different words for each type of snowflake that falls"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 208530,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Really?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 210490,
    "dDurationMs": 610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 211100,
    "dDurationMs": 6230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Similarly, depending on the food that exists, the language and words"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 217330,
    "dDurationMs": 1640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "might have different styles, don't you think?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 218970,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That makes sense, because Eskimo people would see various types of snow"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 223370,
    "dDurationMs": 1810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hmm, so different names are attached to them"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 225180,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm curious"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 226620,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How many do you think there are?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 229410,
    "dDurationMs": 1110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I forgot about that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 231980,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's as far as I go"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 234220,
    "dDurationMs": 1160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 235380,
    "dDurationMs": 4040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "First, there are some tastes that humans can perceive"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 239420,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the first one among them is sweetness"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 242570,
    "dDurationMs": 2420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let's see what kind of expressions there are for it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 244990,
    "dDurationMs": 2050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 247040,
    "dDurationMs": 4870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For sweetness, the representative taste we use is the expression 'sweet'"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 251910,
    "dDurationMs": 1240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "'It's sweet'"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 253150,
    "dDurationMs": 3530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think it's probably the same as the sweetness you all are thinking of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 256680,
    "dDurationMs": 2530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The sweetness of candy, sugar"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 259210,
    "dDurationMs": 1870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But there are also expressions like this"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 261080,
    "dDurationMs": 1210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "sweetly,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 262290,
    "dDurationMs": 1870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "sweetly,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 264160,
    "dDurationMs": 1410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "sweetly-savory"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 265570,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are expressions like these"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 267130,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now let's talk about the differences between these three"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 270530,
    "dDurationMs": 5210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When I think about it, both 'sweetly' and 'sweetly'"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 275740,
    "dDurationMs": 2260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "don't just have sweetness alone"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 278000,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there are various tastes, and among them sweetness comes through slightly"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 282240,
    "dDurationMs": 4730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a little bit, when you want to express it that way, you say 'sweetly' or 'sweetly'"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 286970,
    "dDurationMs": 3330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that's how it seems to be used"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 290300,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What do you think? Do you agree?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 294300,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think similarly"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 298940,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "'Sweetly' and 'sweetly' are really similar words"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 302820,
    "dDurationMs": 8460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "With 'sweetly', the sweet taste I feel"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 311280,
    "dDurationMs": 2020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is a subtle, lingering sensation"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 315040,
    "dDurationMs": 2110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And 'sweetly' is,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 317150,
    "dDurationMs": 860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "'sweetly' is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 318010,
    "dDurationMs": 5120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that sweet taste hits your mouth quite strongly and intensely"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 323130,
    "dDurationMs": 2260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That seems like a very accurate explanation"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 325390,
    "dDurationMs": 1910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is it similar to what you feel too, Didi?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 327300,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 329060,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Of course, we're not experts in taste evaluation or anything like that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 333300,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right, but it does seem accurate though?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 336480,
    "dDurationMs": 740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is that so?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 337220,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I was impressed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 338700,
    "dDurationMs": 6290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So we use this word when food is sweet and makes us feel good"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 344990,
    "dDurationMs": 5510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And when we experience something really wonderful or pleasant while living"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 350500,
    "dDurationMs": 3620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when we feel good like that, we say 'sweetly' or 'sweetly', right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 354120,
    "dDurationMs": 1080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 355200,
    "dDurationMs": 4370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "At that time too, 'sweetly' is that feeling of being really pleased"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 359570,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "hitting you strongly all at once"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 362850,
    "dDurationMs": 2450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the word 'sweetly'"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 365300,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "feels like it's somewhat subtle and somewhat lingering"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 371200,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that kind of feeling"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 372960,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I see, so the 'sweetly' one feels a bit rich"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 375960,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and like a sweetness that lasts longer"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 379080,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the 'sweetly' one has more intensity"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 382160,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when it hits you all at once with sweetness"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 384770,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, what's my feeling?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 387330,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I agree."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 388590,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think we can distinguish it like this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 390270,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the overall thing is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 392870,
    "dDurationMs": 3870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just that you feel a little sweetness."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 396740,
    "dDurationMs": 3730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think that's enough for you to understand."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 400470,
    "dDurationMs": 4890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So with really spicy food like tteokbokki,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 405360,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there are cases where you get a bit of sweetness, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 407840,
    "dDurationMs": 1130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 408970,
    "dDurationMs": 4260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In those cases you can say it's sweet, it's sugary."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 413230,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And among taste expressions,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 415090,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there are quite a few things with 'kom' attached to them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 417490,
    "dDurationMs": 3980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sweet, tangy, spicy-sweet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 421470,
    "dDurationMs": 4720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When you feel a bit of that taste, it seems like you express it this way."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 426190,
    "dDurationMs": 4390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These 'kom' friends can be attached to each other too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 430580,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So in the case of something like tteokbokki,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 432700,
    "dDurationMs": 4460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "spicy-sweet, like spicy-sweet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 437160,
    "dDurationMs": 2410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can express it that way."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 439570,
    "dDurationMs": 4710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And what about 'daljakjireuneun'—what do you think about that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 444280,
    "dDurationMs": 1470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "'Daljakjireuneun'?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 445750,
    "dDurationMs": 5250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The feeling that comes to me is just..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 451000,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "'Daljak,' right, 'jjak.'"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 453300,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "'Jjak,' 'dal-jjak.'"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 454920,
    "dDurationMs": 5350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's like you're tapping it a bit similarly to 'jjak,' you know?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 460270,
    "dDurationMs": 1230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 461500,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it's daljakjireuneun,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 462880,
    "dDurationMs": 4850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like the feeling of tapping something slightly sweet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 467730,
    "dDurationMs": 3660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like a slightly sweet taste is tapped on?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 475310,
    "dDurationMs": 4790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What's that?—So it's not like your tongue gets completely flooded with sweetness,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 482090,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's just tapping, tapping, tapping on it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 485030,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wow, why do you explain things so well?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 486800,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, is that right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 489860,
    "dDurationMs": 1140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For example?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 491000,
    "dDurationMs": 3700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When you ate something, did it taste a bit daljakjireuneun?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 494700,
    "dDurationMs": 2260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Daljakjireuneun... daljakjireuneun..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 496960,
    "dDurationMs": 2150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Um... um... um..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 499110,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, say, a twisted pastry or something."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 500490,
    "dDurationMs": 1730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know, with sugar sprinkled on it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 502220,
    "dDurationMs": 1180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 503400,
    "dDurationMs": 3670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But because that sugar is sprinkled on it, it's sweet,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 507070,
    "dDurationMs": 2630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the bread is flour so it's savory, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 509700,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 511080,
    "dDurationMs": 2680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So when you chew that bread,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 513760,
    "dDurationMs": 3810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the savory taste of the flour bread is there overall,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 517570,
    "dDurationMs": 2750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the sugar sprinkled on it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 520320,
    "dDurationMs": 4590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is tapping, tapping, so it feels daljakjireuneun?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 524910,
    "dDurationMs": 6060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So as you eat, the sweetness hits your tongue like this, one tap at a time?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 530970,
    "dDurationMs": 970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right, that's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 531940,
    "dDurationMs": 5640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you have to intentionally feel the sweetness,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 537580,
    "dDurationMs": 5680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this also seems like a subtle sweetness."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 543260,
    "dDurationMs": 1530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Daljakjireuneun."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 544790,
    "dDurationMs": 3590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right, daljakjireuneun is more like a subtle sweetness rather than outright sweetness,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 548380,
    "dDurationMs": 5760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when it's subtly sweet, you say it's daljakjireuneun."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 554140,
    "dDurationMs": 930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's correct."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 555070,
    "dDurationMs": 4350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm telling you again, we don't know exactly either."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 559420,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, that's scary."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 561340,
    "dDurationMs": 5070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We're doing our best to explain the tastes we've felt living our lives."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 566410,
    "dDurationMs": 1390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 567800,
    "dDurationMs": 2860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So sweetness is like this,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 570660,
    "dDurationMs": 4680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and now the next taste is sour taste, sour taste."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 575340,
    "dDurationMs": 2770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's sour when you eat lemon."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 578110,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What else could there be? Something sour?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 580030,
    "dDurationMs": 890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Vinegar?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 580920,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's sour when you eat vinegar."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 582880,
    "dDurationMs": 880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 583760,
    "dDurationMs": 2650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, so the words that express sour taste"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 586410,
    "dDurationMs": 1720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I've brought two kinds."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 588130,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "First, the basic form is '시다', '셔요',"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 592530,
    "dDurationMs": 1090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and another taste you can express"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 593620,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is '새콤하다',"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 595240,
    "dDurationMs": 2140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and there's '시큼하다'."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 597380,
    "dDurationMs": 2890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Should we distinguish between these two?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 600270,
    "dDurationMs": 1120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, yes, that sounds good."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 601390,
    "dDurationMs": 2360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In my opinion,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 603750,
    "dDurationMs": 7220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "first, like we talked about before, when you add '콤' it becomes \"slightly sour,\" but"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 610970,
    "dDurationMs": 1750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "'새콤한' is..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 612720,
    "dDurationMs": 2770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "'새콤한' feels kind of nice."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 615490,
    "dDurationMs": 3050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When you eat it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 618540,
    "dDurationMs": 3850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for example, like the sourness of fruit, you know?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 622390,
    "dDurationMs": 3110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's a bit fresh and tangy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 625500,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When you eat that, it doesn't feel bad."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 628600,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But '시큼하다' is more like vinegar—"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 631920,
    "dDurationMs": 4050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when you eat it, it's not a sourness that makes you feel good."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 638170,
    "dDurationMs": 1700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like \"Ugh, sour 😖\"—that kind of feeling?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 639870,
    "dDurationMs": 2470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's more '시큼하다'."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 642340,
    "dDurationMs": 1240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right, I agree."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 643580,
    "dDurationMs": 1090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You agree?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 644670,
    "dDurationMs": 1010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 645680,
    "dDurationMs": 1850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Delicious sourness is '새콤하다'."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 647530,
    "dDurationMs": 3610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When something's fermented and sour, that's '시큼하다'."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 651140,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, that's right, that's right—I was actually about to say that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 653690,
    "dDurationMs": 1730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, really?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 655420,
    "dDurationMs": 3460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sometimes there are foods that shouldn't taste sour,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 658880,
    "dDurationMs": 2530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but they have a sour taste for some reason."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 661410,
    "dDurationMs": 1730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 663140,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then you think, oh, this food must be old."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 667740,
    "dDurationMs": 3750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, if I eat this I'll get a stomachache."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 671490,
    "dDurationMs": 3750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We call that the food has gone off, or is stale."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 675240,
    "dDurationMs": 1300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 676540,
    "dDurationMs": 3650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, hmm, why does this doenjang-jjigae taste sour?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 680190,
    "dDurationMs": 1090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 681280,
    "dDurationMs": 1350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You say things like that, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 682630,
    "dDurationMs": 1870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 684500,
    "dDurationMs": 1390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's savory and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 685890,
    "dDurationMs": 7480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "something with that kind of mild, nutty flavor,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 693370,
    "dDurationMs": 2890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it has a sour taste...? That shouldn't happen."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 696260,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 698690,
    "dDurationMs": 2780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When the taste of the food has turned sour,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 701470,
    "dDurationMs": 1340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 702810,
    "dDurationMs": 3870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So like you said, Didi,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 706680,
    "dDurationMs": 3700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you wouldn't say, \"Oh, Mom, the doenjang-jjigae tastes '새콤하다'?\" right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 710380,
    "dDurationMs": 1780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, that's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 712160,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, that's how it is."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 714660,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "'새콤하다' is usually used when talking about something delicious."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 717260,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, this seems really helpful."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 720700,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It does."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 722290,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "'시큼하다' and '새콤하다'—"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 725020,
    "dDurationMs": 1750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you explained the difference really well,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 726770,
    "dDurationMs": 1820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "next taste!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 728590,
    "dDurationMs": 5090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Next is '짜다', the salty taste—that's salt, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 733680,
    "dDurationMs": 900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 734580,
    "dDurationMs": 4090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Salt, soy sauce, things like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 738670,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the basic form for salty taste is 'tta-da' (짜다)."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 741220,
    "dDurationMs": 3740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And now there's another expression to describe salty taste,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 744960,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is 'ttabjjal-ha-da' (짭짤하다),"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 747440,
    "dDurationMs": 2440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then there's 'ttabjjo-reum-ha-da' (짭조름하다)."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 749880,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are words like this too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 752180,
    "dDurationMs": 1630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Two kinds..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 753810,
    "dDurationMs": 2860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is advanced Korean class."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 756670,
    "dDurationMs": 740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 757410,
    "dDurationMs": 4130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What do you think about 'ttabjjal-ha-da' and 'ttabjjo-reum-ha-da'?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 761540,
    "dDurationMs": 2030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ah, but honestly speaking,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 763570,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 764830,
    "dDurationMs": 4480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I didn't really prepare this, you know, what we're talking about right now—"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 769310,
    "dDurationMs": 1720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm just freestyling all of it right now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 771030,
    "dDurationMs": 2680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, you're doing really well."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 773710,
    "dDurationMs": 2180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ah, thank you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 775890,
    "dDurationMs": 6800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think this is where the charm of Korean really comes out as an expression."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 782690,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When we eat something salty, what do we do?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 785720,
    "dDurationMs": 2210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ah, like this, 'tschup tschup' (쩝쩝)."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 787930,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "'Ugh, salty,' like that, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 790830,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's that salty feeling in your mouth,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 793730,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but after you taste it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 796190,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and say 'Oh, this is salty!' up to that point,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 799230,
    "dDurationMs": 3070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that distance—"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 802300,
    "dDurationMs": 3690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, 'tta-da' and 'ttabjjal-ha-da' are two syllables each, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 805990,
    "dDurationMs": 5310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But it's subtly salty, like, 'Hmm, is this salty?'"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 811300,
    "dDurationMs": 5870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then it's ttabjjo-reum..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 817170,
    "dDurationMs": 4690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Can you relate it to the number of syllables too?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 821860,
    "dDurationMs": 5480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it expresses the distance before you get to 'tta-da', right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 827340,
    "dDurationMs": 6270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "'Ttabjjo-reum' with three syllables isn't that strongly salty,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 833610,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if it's a bit stronger than that, it's 'ttabjjal-ha-da',"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 836880,
    "dDurationMs": 2290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if it gets stronger than that, it's 'tta-da'."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 839170,
    "dDurationMs": 2140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "'Ugh, salty!' like that..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 844370,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think I understand what you mean."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 846560,
    "dDurationMs": 1250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right, right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 847810,
    "dDurationMs": 2020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As you think about it, the words get longer, you know?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 849830,
    "dDurationMs": 4140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "'Ttabjjo-reum...' like that's what happens."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 853970,
    "dDurationMs": 1010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 854980,
    "dDurationMs": 3260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But actually, when it comes to salty taste,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 858240,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if you feel it strongly right away,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 860190,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that's food without flavor, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 861900,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 863280,
    "dDurationMs": 2860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So when you say 'tta-da,' it has no flavor,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 866140,
    "dDurationMs": 3670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but when this distance is longer and you feel a moderately salty taste,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 869810,
    "dDurationMs": 740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that's really delicious."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 873280,
    "dDurationMs": 4350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So doesn't food that's 'ttabjjo-reum-ha-da' feel worth eating?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 877630,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think it's a good expression, 'ttabjjo-reum-ha-da'."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 881230,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Pleasantly salty."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 883720,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The seasoning is just right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 886120,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's 'ttabjjo-reum-ha-da' on the tongue,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 889020,
    "dDurationMs": 3630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the tongue gets vitality all at once, that kind of feeling."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 892650,
    "dDurationMs": 1580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wow, do foreign languages have expressions like this?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 894230,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A pleasantly salty taste."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 896830,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "'Ttabjjo-reum-ha-da'."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 899590,
    "dDurationMs": 1080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can express it like this,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 900670,
    "dDurationMs": 4650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and if it's a bit more salty than that, you feel more of the salty taste, then"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 905320,
    "dDurationMs": 1870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "'Oh, this is a bit ttabjjal-ha-da.'"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 907190,
    "dDurationMs": 1730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can express it like this,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 908920,
    "dDurationMs": 4530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and really salty stuff you express as 'tta-da'."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 913450,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wow, we're doing well!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 916850,
    "dDurationMs": 2650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thank you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 919500,
    "dDurationMs": 3190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the bitter taste is..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 922690,
    "dDurationMs": 3810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like with coffee or alcohol, we say it tastes bitter, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 926500,
    "dDurationMs": 2890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are words that can express this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 929390,
    "dDurationMs": 1230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are these."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 930620,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sseupsseulhada."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 931940,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's also this word, or you can also express it as ssaalsalhada."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 934610,
    "dDurationMs": 2360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can express it this way too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 936970,
    "dDurationMs": 5250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What kind of bitter taste is this? A bitter taste that's sseupsseul and ssaalsalhan?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 942220,
    "dDurationMs": 1580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's true."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 943800,
    "dDurationMs": 5580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ssaalsalhada feels a bit less bitter than sseupsseulhada, I think."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 949380,
    "dDurationMs": 1720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Less bitter than sseupsseulhada?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 951100,
    "dDurationMs": 1570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, that's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 952670,
    "dDurationMs": 3670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, I thought the two were almost similar."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 956340,
    "dDurationMs": 2980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I grouped them together."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 959320,
    "dDurationMs": 4030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And usually ssaalsalhada is used with dalkomssaalsalhada."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 963350,
    "dDurationMs": 6120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It seems like it's often used together with sweet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 969470,
    "dDurationMs": 2150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sweet and ssaalsal."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 971620,
    "dDurationMs": 5380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Does that mean it's a ssaalsal taste you can tolerate?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 977000,
    "dDurationMs": 2170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A bitter taste you can tolerate?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 979170,
    "dDurationMs": 4720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A bitter taste you can enjoy?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 983890,
    "dDurationMs": 2930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm not sure about this one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 986820,
    "dDurationMs": 1690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ssaalsalhada."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 988510,
    "dDurationMs": 6370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sseupsseulhada, ssaalsalhada—I don't like bitter foods, so..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 994880,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sseupsseulhada."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 996640,
    "dDurationMs": 3580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think it's a subtle bitter taste."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1000220,
    "dDurationMs": 3750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A weak, not strong bitter taste—sseupsseulhada, ssaalsalhada."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1003970,
    "dDurationMs": 3130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It seems like you can express it with these two ways."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1007100,
    "dDurationMs": 5360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Both mean the bitter taste is less, but if I had to distinguish between them,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1012460,
    "dDurationMs": 7190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, ssaalsalhan seems like a bitter taste you can enjoy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1019650,
    "dDurationMs": 4880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So with coffee and things like that, is it ssaalsalhan?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1024530,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ah, a bit ssaalsalhan?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1028770,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But I discovered another difference."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1031350,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, what is it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1033470,
    "dDurationMs": 4120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "'Sseupsseulhada' is just 'sseupsseulhada,'"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1037590,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But 'ssaalsalhada'"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1039150,
    "dDurationMs": 2950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is said as 'ssaalsarumhada.'"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1042100,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "'Ssaalsarumhada'?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1044200,
    "dDurationMs": 2180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's getting harder and harder?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1046380,
    "dDurationMs": 4840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "'Ssaalsarumhada'—why is that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1051220,
    "dDurationMs": 2990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But this is similar to 'jjapjjalhada,'"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1054210,
    "dDurationMs": 3740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "'jjapjorumhada' in some ways."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1057950,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, yes, that's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1060290,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes yes, ssaalsarumhan is that slight bitter feeling"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1063770,
    "dDurationMs": 1670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That lingers a bit?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1067140,
    "dDurationMs": 3530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The bitter taste stays in your mouth a little bit"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1070670,
    "dDurationMs": 5590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It lasts a while—ssaalsarum~~~~~hage."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1076260,
    "dDurationMs": 3260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh yes yes yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1079520,
    "dDurationMs": 4220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So could coffee be ssaalsarumhal?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1083740,
    "dDurationMs": 2270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ugh, ssaalsarumhada."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1087840,
    "dDurationMs": 3550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But usually when people drink coffee,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1091390,
    "dDurationMs": 5470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The person drinking coffee wants to look cool—so they pretend it's not bitter?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1096860,
    "dDurationMs": 3940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ssaalsarumhada doesn't sound cool."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1100800,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's a bit more homey, the expression?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1103020,
    "dDurationMs": 2180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, so even though it's ssaalsarumhan,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1105200,
    "dDurationMs": 3740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "People don't seem to say ssaalsarumhada."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1108940,
    "dDurationMs": 2380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think it's also with Korean food"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1111320,
    "dDurationMs": 5290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Or when explaining herbal medicine ingredients? Medicinal ingredients? Things like that,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1116610,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It seems like it's used quite a lot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1118850,
    "dDurationMs": 890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1119740,
    "dDurationMs": 2530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It sounds a bit strange when you attach it to foreign food."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1122270,
    "dDurationMs": 1110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I see."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1123380,
    "dDurationMs": 1370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's true."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1124750,
    "dDurationMs": 1670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ginseng, seasoned vegetables."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1126420,
    "dDurationMs": 2860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We use it when eating things like this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1129280,
    "dDurationMs": 1820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Slightly bitter."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1131100,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know burnt food?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1132690,
    "dDurationMs": 920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What kind of food?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1133610,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When food is burnt."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1135230,
    "dDurationMs": 1350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1136580,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So when you eat something like that, how would you express it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1139680,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Do you say it's bitter?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1142350,
    "dDurationMs": 910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Isn't that right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1143260,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Burnt, bitter."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1145060,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We don't say \"bittersweet,\" right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1147520,
    "dDurationMs": 1530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1149050,
    "dDurationMs": 1750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When you eat burnt food,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1150800,
    "dDurationMs": 3650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "First, before you can even express it, you have to spit it out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1154450,
    "dDurationMs": 940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ptooey."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1157130,
    "dDurationMs": 3930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ugh, ptooey ptooey ptooey! That's the only expression that comes out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1161060,
    "dDurationMs": 3570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Isn't it just that the taste is gone?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1164630,
    "dDurationMs": 4970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Still, if we're talking about taste expressions, I think only \"bitter\" works."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1169600,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1170920,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"Bittersweet\" and \"slightly bitter\" seem to have a somewhat pleasant feeling."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1174820,
    "dDurationMs": 1790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When you taste this flavor,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1176610,
    "dDurationMs": 5600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's an expression you use for the food itself first."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1182210,
    "dDurationMs": 1090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1183300,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's a bit bittersweet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1186020,
    "dDurationMs": 3380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can also use \"bittersweet\" as an emotional expression too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1189400,
    "dDurationMs": 1220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1190620,
    "dDurationMs": 3950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A somewhat subtly painful feeling."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1194570,
    "dDurationMs": 830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1195400,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Bittersweet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1196600,
    "dDurationMs": 2060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Bittersweet, bittersweet is..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1198660,
    "dDurationMs": 3380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It really seems like just the painful kind."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1202040,
    "dDurationMs": 4580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When you express something like \"it's slightly bitter,\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1206620,
    "dDurationMs": 5400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It feels like there's not just bad parts to it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1212020,
    "dDurationMs": 3340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Do you also express a situation as \"slightly bitter\"?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1215360,
    "dDurationMs": 3020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This seems like very advanced Korean,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1218380,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I think it's better to skip it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1221170,
    "dDurationMs": 990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Okay."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1222160,
    "dDurationMs": 2570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So we could distinguish \"bitter\" to that extent,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1224730,
    "dDurationMs": 1140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"Bitter\" is a bit difficult."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1225870,
    "dDurationMs": 5030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Since there aren't really many bitter foods,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1230900,
    "dDurationMs": 1640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It seems hard to make the connection."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1232540,
    "dDurationMs": 4300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So then, let's move on to the much-anticipated spicy flavor."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1236840,
    "dDurationMs": 4680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think many people probably find it difficult to distinguish when expressing spicy flavors."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1241520,
    "dDurationMs": 3530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The basic form of spicy is \"mapta,\" right? \"Maewo,\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1245050,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"Maepne,\" you can say it like this,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1247570,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But there are other words"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1249770,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I've brought five of them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1252380,
    "dDurationMs": 2630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "First, \"slightly spicy.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1255010,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Second, \"sharp and spicy.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1257090,
    "dDurationMs": 2450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Third, \"tingling spicy.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1259540,
    "dDurationMs": 2270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Fourth is \"peppery spicy.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1261810,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Fifth, \"numbing spicy.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1264270,
    "dDurationMs": 1580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I brought these."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1265850,
    "dDurationMs": 1820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's a lot, isn't it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1267670,
    "dDurationMs": 820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It really is."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1268490,
    "dDurationMs": 1700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Should I explain it step by step?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1270190,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What do you think about \"maekkomhada\"?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1272410,
    "dDurationMs": 4410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, it has a somewhat positive meaning, a good connotation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1276820,
    "dDurationMs": 1070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I agree."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1277890,
    "dDurationMs": 4960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's that kind of spiciness where it's spicy but tasty, you know?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1282850,
    "dDurationMs": 2170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is there anything else you're noticing?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1285020,
    "dDurationMs": 3260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And also, the spiciness isn't too strong."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1288280,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's spicy in an edible way."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1290560,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right, that's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1292160,
    "dDurationMs": 3690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It feels like it's made spicy just to make it taste good."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1295850,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1297170,
    "dDurationMs": 2540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Spicy in an edible way,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1299710,
    "dDurationMs": 5250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it tastes good, so you feel good?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1304960,
    "dDurationMs": 2110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, but when you think about it more,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1307070,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "all the expressions we're talking about are actually like that, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1309470,
    "dDurationMs": 7010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But I think it would be good to point out where you feel the spiciness,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1316480,
    "dDurationMs": 3020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you know?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1319500,
    "dDurationMs": 3010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, compared to other expressions..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1322510,
    "dDurationMs": 1810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Okay, so then..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1324320,
    "dDurationMs": 4250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"Maekkomhada\" is just the whole tongue"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1328570,
    "dDurationMs": 5140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and like the roof of your mouth here, that's where you feel the spiciness."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1333710,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, when your mouth feels spicy,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1335840,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right, your mouth gets hot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1338180,
    "dDurationMs": 1530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right, inside your mouth."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1339710,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So what about \"kalkalahada\"?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1341670,
    "dDurationMs": 1670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"Kalkalahada\"..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1343340,
    "dDurationMs": 4790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"Kalkalahada\" is like \"mapta\" or \"maekkomhada,\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1348130,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but your mouth doesn't get hot like that,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1349900,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so there's not that much burden inside your mouth."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1352060,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Your tongue doesn't suffer that much."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1354620,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But you feel a bit of spiciness in your throat area."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1358340,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right, it's the throat. That's what \"kalkalhada\" is."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1361400,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, so you do feel the spiciness,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1365120,
    "dDurationMs": 4410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but your mouth doesn't suffer that much,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1369530,
    "dDurationMs": 4390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so that refreshing spiciness that comes from here?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1373920,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think it's kind of like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1376770,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We'll talk more about the word \"refreshing\" later,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1380930,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but \"kalkalhada\" is right—it's a taste that stimulates your throat."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1385930,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When you catch a cold, you also say your throat is \"kalkalhada,\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1389090,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when your throat feels a bit hoarse like this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1391460,
    "dDurationMs": 4470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like that, to the point where your throat hurts like this,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1395930,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you feel the spiciness in your throat."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1399450,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A typical example is when you eat something like broth."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1402730,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Broth passes quickly through your mouth like this, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1406410,
    "dDurationMs": 3010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So when it passes right through your throat here,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1409420,
    "dDurationMs": 3970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you feel the spiciness—that's what \"kalkalhada\" seems to be."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1413390,
    "dDurationMs": 2860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right, that's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1416250,
    "dDurationMs": 5610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Okay, we've covered that, so what about \"eolkkeunhada\"?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1421860,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To talk about \"eolkkeunhada,\" \"eolkkeunhada,\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1424800,
    "dDurationMs": 4490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we need to talk about \"refreshing,\" but we said we'd do that later, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1429290,
    "dDurationMs": 2290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So should we do \"refreshing\" then?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1431580,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Should we do \"refreshing\" first?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1433500,
    "dDurationMs": 5610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Foreigners get really confused about this, you know."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1439110,
    "dDurationMs": 1390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1440500,
    "dDurationMs": 3710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Why do you say it's refreshing when you eat hot food?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1444210,
    "dDurationMs": 1020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1445230,
    "dDurationMs": 5590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I also saw it in books and comics when I was young,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1450820,
    "dDurationMs": 5210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like when older people go into a bathhouse and say it's refreshing,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1456030,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "saying it's refreshing even though it's hot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1459530,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But originally \"refreshing\" is something closer to cold, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1463070,
    "dDurationMs": 2810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When the wind blows, your body gets a bit cold, which is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1465880,
    "dDurationMs": 1310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "refreshing, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1467190,
    "dDurationMs": 3930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But when you sweat like that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1471120,
    "dDurationMs": 5500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "your overall blood circulation improves"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1476620,
    "dDurationMs": 1940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and actually when you sweat"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1478560,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you feel a bit refreshed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1481640,
    "dDurationMs": 2890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like when you feel refreshed after sleeping well and waking up, your body feels light, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1484530,
    "dDurationMs": 6770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so they use the expression that your overall mood feels refreshing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1491300,
    "dDurationMs": 3010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I think I've seen it explained that way somewhere"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1494310,
    "dDurationMs": 1410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, I think so too"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1497090,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I prepared just one thing for this"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1501410,
    "dDurationMs": 4220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I also thought about the expression \"refreshing\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1505630,
    "dDurationMs": 3780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the \"refreshed\" feeling that Didi mentioned earlier"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1509410,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the expression \"refreshed\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1511360,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "basically your insides feel refreshing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1515680,
    "dDurationMs": 3890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so the \"refreshing\" we're talking about here"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1519570,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "isn't that the outside is refreshing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1520950,
    "dDurationMs": 3530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but it's a feeling that my insides are refreshing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1524480,
    "dDurationMs": 4380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but when you eat hot food your body gets hot"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1528860,
    "dDurationMs": 3110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so why would it feel refreshing? You could think that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1531970,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so how to express this word \"refreshing\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1533950,
    "dDurationMs": 3590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I thought about it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1537540,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there's this kind of expression in Korean"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1540640,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"a wide-open refreshing highway\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1545280,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so we're driving on a highway"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1549600,
    "dDurationMs": 2530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and there are no other cars in front"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1552130,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so I'm the only one on the road"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1555010,
    "dDurationMs": 3660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so when you just drive straight it feels so refreshing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1560030,
    "dDurationMs": 5110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this also isn't just cold air or wind feeling refreshing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1565140,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's more like that fast whooshing feeling?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1568200,
    "dDurationMs": 1660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "oh, right"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1569860,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but when you eat and drink these warm"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1574660,
    "dDurationMs": 8030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and umami-rich broth-based dishes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1582690,
    "dDurationMs": 5810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that warm broth doesn't really catch in your mouth"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1588500,
    "dDurationMs": 3250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it goes down your throat smoothly"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1591750,
    "dDurationMs": 2380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and goes into your stomach"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1594130,
    "dDurationMs": 4830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you feel like the path from your mouth to your stomach is wide-open"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1598960,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and since you feel that warm broth all the way down that path"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1603360,
    "dDurationMs": 8190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's that feeling of going down smoothly like a wide-open highway"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1611550,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you compared it to a highway"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1613980,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "yes, that's how I thought about it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1616140,
    "dDurationMs": 4850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so it's that refreshing feeling of things going down without any blockage?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1620990,
    "dDurationMs": 2770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "yes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1623760,
    "dDurationMs": 5530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so when we talk about something being refreshing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1629290,
    "dDurationMs": 4440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so when it's not temperature but the taste is refreshing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1633730,
    "dDurationMs": 2890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from what I know, it's all broth"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1636620,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "ah"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1639140,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "yes it's liquid, yes liquid"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1642080,
    "dDurationMs": 1060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's only used for broth"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1643140,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "liquid right"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1644540,
    "dDurationMs": 1250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "right right"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1645790,
    "dDurationMs": 730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "yes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1646520,
    "dDurationMs": 5770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so this isn't talking about a taste you feel in your mouth, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1652290,
    "dDurationMs": 2690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's talking about a feeling"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1654980,
    "dDurationMs": 3020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "yes yes yes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1658000,
    "dDurationMs": 2990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so this isn't a spicy taste either"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1660990,
    "dDurationMs": 3330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you can't express it as a taste"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1664320,
    "dDurationMs": 5950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "temperature and feeling, the feeling when you eat it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1670270,
    "dDurationMs": 2980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but if I add one more thing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1673250,
    "dDurationMs": 5450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "usually broth, what they call broth"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1678700,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So like, most broths are that way."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1682180,
    "dDurationMs": 5190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You extract meat or vegetables or things like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1687370,
    "dDurationMs": 7090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the fat from the meat, the meat broth or the water from the vegetables—"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1694460,
    "dDurationMs": 3740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When that warm broth goes down your throat,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1698200,
    "dDurationMs": 4790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you feel the aroma of the broth spreading through you, you know?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1702990,
    "dDurationMs": 3830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right, so when I was originally explaining \"refreshing,\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1706820,
    "dDurationMs": 2680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I was trying to talk about it as a deep flavor."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1709500,
    "dDurationMs": 2660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The depth of the broth being deep,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1712160,
    "dDurationMs": 3550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like when you put in a lot of ingredients and boil it for a long time, that kind of taste."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1715710,
    "dDurationMs": 5370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When you say the ingredients have a deep flavor, you can express it as \"refreshing.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1721080,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's what I was trying to say..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1723420,
    "dDurationMs": 1870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That kind of explanation helps too, but"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1725290,
    "dDurationMs": 5300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "definitely that feeling of it passing through your throat and the feeling when you eat it—"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1730590,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it becomes warm like this and calms down,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1733410,
    "dDurationMs": 3990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when you get that feeling of your mood improving,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1737400,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that's when you express it as \"refreshing.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1740300,
    "dDurationMs": 890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1741190,
    "dDurationMs": 3620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, so for me, it's not just in Korean food,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1744810,
    "dDurationMs": 2230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when I went to Vietnam,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1747040,
    "dDurationMs": 5060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I ate pho and the broth was so refreshing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1752100,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like that feeling of your stomach settling? You know?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1756060,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In those moments I use \"refreshing\" a lot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1759420,
    "dDurationMs": 6820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That deep beef broth"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1766240,
    "dDurationMs": 4290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "goes straight down from your mouth to your stomach with a whoosh."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1770530,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wow."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1772180,
    "dDurationMs": 3490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think that might not have been perfectly understood,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1775670,
    "dDurationMs": 2770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but anyway, since we're talking about \"refreshing,\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1778440,
    "dDurationMs": 6120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then what about \"eolkeun\"—\"eolkeun\" means—"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1784560,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So simply put, when a spicy flavor and a refreshing flavor come together,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1789360,
    "dDurationMs": 1670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you can think of it as \"eolkeun.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1793270,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I see, so when spicy and refreshing combine, it becomes eolkeun."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1798270,
    "dDurationMs": 3930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Usually when people say \"refreshing,\" they don't just say"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1802200,
    "dDurationMs": 2140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"refreshing\" like that,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1804340,
    "dDurationMs": 2840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they say \"Ah~ refreshing\" like this,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1807180,
    "dDurationMs": 3990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there's kind of that feeling coming up from here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1811170,
    "dDurationMs": 2830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wow~~~ refreshing, like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1814000,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the pho you mentioned,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1816920,
    "dDurationMs": 1340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "gomtang,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1818260,
    "dDurationMs": 1280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "pork soup rice bowl,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1819540,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "these non-spicy foods can be refreshing too, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1823340,
    "dDurationMs": 1420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1824760,
    "dDurationMs": 4150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When you eat those and say \"Ah~~~ refreshing,\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1828910,
    "dDurationMs": 2180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like kimchi jjigae,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1831090,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "pork kimchi jjigae,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1833210,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "things like that, or jjamppong, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1836510,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When you eat those it's equally refreshing,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1838730,
    "dDurationMs": 1420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but there's also spiciness,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1840150,
    "dDurationMs": 3380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so you can say \"Hey, that's eolkeun\" like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1843530,
    "dDurationMs": 2470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Perfect."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1846000,
    "dDurationMs": 4580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Usually \"refreshing\" is used a lot together with \"haejangs,\" isn't it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1850580,
    "dDurationMs": 4050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, that's a good point—I think it would be good to connect that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1854630,
    "dDurationMs": 3810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You might not know the expression \"haejang,\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1858440,
    "dDurationMs": 1720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but usually after you drink alcohol,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1860160,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the next day you have a hangover, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1863370,
    "dDurationMs": 2380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That uncomfortable feeling in your stomach,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1865750,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "your mood isn't good and your stomach isn't good,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1868690,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in those times you eat haejang food."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1871630,
    "dDurationMs": 3380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Food that makes your stomach feel comfortable."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1875010,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think it would be good to think about that feeling too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1877710,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Your stomach becomes comfortable and settles."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1879510,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So when you eat those kinds of foods, you say 'Ah, it's refreshing'"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1883430,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Your stomach feels a bit relieved"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1884630,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are many ways to express it like this"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1887190,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1888690,
    "dDurationMs": 1490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Even up to 'eolkeun'"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1890180,
    "dDurationMs": 4060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Spicy foods that are eolkeun are eaten a lot as hangover cures"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1894240,
    "dDurationMs": 1780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's good, really good"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1896020,
    "dDurationMs": 3590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And now we have 'alssahada' and 'eoleorhada' left"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1899610,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What about the 'alssahan' one?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1903050,
    "dDurationMs": 2630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think 'alssahada' is very straightforward"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1905680,
    "dDurationMs": 1700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's a very representative food for it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1907380,
    "dDurationMs": 1370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What is it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1908750,
    "dDurationMs": 2540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wasabi"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1911290,
    "dDurationMs": 3490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In Korean we call it gochu-naengyi"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1914780,
    "dDurationMs": 5160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That also makes your mouth hurt and it's not spicy in the regular way"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1919940,
    "dDurationMs": 6020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's more like this sharp feeling through your nose"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1925960,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1928460,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's a bit painful"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1929460,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the tip of the tongue"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1930660,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When the tip of my tongue hurts a bit"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1932880,
    "dDurationMs": 4410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I seem to talk about it being alssahan a lot"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1937290,
    "dDurationMs": 4920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When you eat things like ddaeng-cho chicken, you say it's alssahan"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1942210,
    "dDurationMs": 740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right, that's right"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1942950,
    "dDurationMs": 3830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Your nose or the tip of your tongue feels a bit stinging"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1946780,
    "dDurationMs": 1690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Tingling"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1948470,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That kind of spicy taste seems to be what alssahan taste is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1952550,
    "dDurationMs": 3890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, and that sharp, prickling feeling?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1956440,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That sharp, prickling feeling"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1958270,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1959890,
    "dDurationMs": 5190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When you eat things like ddaeng-cho chicken, that's it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1965080,
    "dDurationMs": 810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's the alssahan taste"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1965890,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What about the eoleorhada taste?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1967540,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This one also seems to have a representative food"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1971040,
    "dDurationMs": 1090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What is it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1972130,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mala tang?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1975160,
    "dDurationMs": 2590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mala, mala"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1977750,
    "dDurationMs": 4890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Your whole mouth gets that eoleorhada feeling from mala"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1982640,
    "dDurationMs": 1610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is eoleorhada really eoleorhada?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1987280,
    "dDurationMs": 2090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I talked about it and thought it was strange"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1989370,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I have an expression I think of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1991290,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, what is it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1992550,
    "dDurationMs": 1690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What eoleorhada is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1995220,
    "dDurationMs": 2630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is a throbbing feeling in your tongue and the roof of your mouth"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1997850,
    "dDurationMs": 1730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ah, I thought about that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1999580,
    "dDurationMs": 3350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like some kind of throbbing pain like that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2002930,
    "dDurationMs": 2110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, yes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2005040,
    "dDurationMs": 4930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Your tongue is just like this, throbbing throbbing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2009970,
    "dDurationMs": 1030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What do I do"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2011000,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right, it's like a pain like this"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2014200,
    "dDurationMs": 3290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Spicy taste is originally a painful taste anyway"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2017490,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's painful, that's true, but"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2021490,
    "dDurationMs": 2270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Throbbing pain"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2023760,
    "dDurationMs": 1630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2025390,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That seems to be what 'eoleorhada' is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2027610,
    "dDurationMs": 4120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So when I additionally explain the 'mapta' expression"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2031730,
    "dDurationMs": 4550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What the person who asked that question was confused about"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2036280,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is 'sappari' from Japanese"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2039670,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's a similar expression to 'sangkumhada'"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2041950,
    "dDurationMs": 3640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you think about it in Korean, it's like eating a lemon salad or"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2045590,
    "dDurationMs": 3930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Something like that, that fresh feeling"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2049520,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In Korea, we call that 'sangkkeumhada'"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2051470,
    "dDurationMs": 4050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or 'santteutthada' — that's how we express it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2055520,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, to answer what you were curious about,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2059040,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's completely different from 'siwonhada'"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2062940,
    "dDurationMs": 2620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it's a similar expression to that Japanese 'sappari'"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2065560,
    "dDurationMs": 4890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'll explain just up to 'sangkkeumhada' and 'santteutthada'"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2070450,
    "dDurationMs": 6820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Can you feel the difference between 'sangkkeumhada' and 'santteutthada'?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2077270,
    "dDurationMs": 3670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Actually, when I eat food,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2080940,
    "dDurationMs": 3860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I've almost never used the expression 'santteutthada'..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2084800,
    "dDurationMs": 3130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ah, 'santteutthada'"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2087930,
    "dDurationMs": 1370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In my opinion,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2089300,
    "dDurationMs": 3580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "'sangkkeumhan' is closer to fruit, the way I think about it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2092880,
    "dDurationMs": 2030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When you eat fruit,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2094910,
    "dDurationMs": 5950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it feels kind of refreshing and really refreshing and a bit clean"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2100860,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like your mouth gets cleaned"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2103060,
    "dDurationMs": 3750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "things like lemonade"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2106810,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you can talk about 'sangkkeumhada'"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2109810,
    "dDurationMs": 4840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "'santteutthada' has a bit of a fresh feeling too"
