  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2208640,
    "dDurationMs": 5050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "about the 'siwonhada' taste, which we mentioned the most,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2213690,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the question is: which of the following is NOT a food with a siwonhada taste?"
